<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6774678488"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:51.910"><div begin="34.186" end="50.290"><p begin="34.186" end="38.119" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.186" end="34.508">我</span><span begin="34.508" end="35.002">总是</span><span begin="35.002" end="36.037">轻描淡写</span><span begin="36.037" end="36.786">告诉你</span><span begin="36.786" end="37.535">我的愿</span><span begin="37.535" end="38.119">望</span></p><p begin="38.315" end="42.202" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.315" end="39.085">也给你</span><span begin="39.085" end="40.101">千言万语</span><span begin="40.101" end="41.119">都说不尽</span><span begin="41.119" end="41.634">的目</span><span begin="41.634" end="42.202">光</span></p><p begin="42.393" end="46.233" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.393" end="43.147">这世界</span><span begin="43.147" end="44.147">总有人在</span><span begin="44.147" end="45.182">忙忙碌碌</span><span begin="45.182" end="45.665">寻宝</span><span begin="45.665" end="46.233">藏</span></p><p begin="46.439" end="50.290" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.439" end="47.189">却误了</span><span begin="47.189" end="48.005">浮世骄</span><span begin="48.005" end="48.299">阳</span><span begin="48.490" end="49.223">也错过</span><span begin="49.223" end="49.957">人间万</span><span begin="49.957" end="50.290">象</span></p></div><div begin="50.231" end="1:20.665"><p begin="50.231" end="53.518" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.231" end="50.745">古</span><span begin="50.745" end="51.012">城</span><span begin="51.012" end="51.529">里</span> <span begin="51.529" end="52.044">长桥</span><span begin="52.044" end="53.518">上</span></p><p begin="54.245" end="57.309" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.245" end="54.792">人</span><span begin="54.792" end="55.090">如</span><span begin="55.090" end="55.564">海</span> <span begin="55.564" end="56.125">车成</span><span begin="56.125" end="57.309">行</span></p><p begin="58.297" end="1:00.627" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent=