545" end="1:23.011">一</span><span begin="1:23.011" end="1:23.811">笑倾城</span> <span begin="1:23.811" end="1:24.611">一见自</span><span begin="1:24.611" end="1:25.078">难</span><span begin="1:25.078" end="1:25.478">忘</span></p><p begin="1:25.840" end="1:29.554" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.840" end="1:26.602">说什么</span><span begin="1:26.602" end="1:27.021">情</span><span begin="1:27.021" end="1:27.887">深似海</span><span begin="1:27.887" end="1:28.653">我却不</span><span begin="1:28.653" end="1:29.138">敢</span><span begin="1:29.138" end="1:29.554">当</span></p><p begin="1:29.865" end="1:33.582" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.865" end="1:30.672">最浪漫</span><span begin="1:30.672" end="1:31.189">不</span><span begin="1:31.189" end="1:31.922">过与你</span><span begin="1:31.922" end="1:32.722">并肩看</span><span begin="1:32.722" end="1:33.189">夕</span><span begin="1:33.189" end="1:33.582">阳</span></p><p begin="1:33.731" end="1:38.751" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.731" end="1:34.426">我心之</span><span begin="1:34.426" end="1:34.779">所</span><span begin="1:34.779" end="1:36.293">向</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="1:34.939" end="1:36.001">(并肩去看</span><span begin="1:36.001" end="1:36.267">夕</span><span begin="1:36.267" end="1:36.624">阳</span> <span begin="1:36.750" end="1:37.251">我</span><span begin="1:37.251" end="1:38.350">的心之所</span><span begin="1:38.350" end="1:38.751">向)</span></span></p><p begin="1:37.952" end="1:41.746" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.952" end="1:38.847">想和你</span><span begin="1:38.847" end="1:39.298">游</span><span begin="1:39.298" end="1:40.047">四方 赏</span><span begin="1:40.047" end="1:40.847">晴雨的</span><span begin="1:40.847" end="1:41.364">风</span><span begin="1:41.364" end="1:41.746">光</span></p><p begin="1:42.077" end="1:45.842" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.077" end="1:42.909">想和你</span><span begin="1:42.909" end="1:43.320">铺</span><span begin="1:43.375" end="1:44